# Extraction decisions

**Source:** SEC EDGAR via `sec-edgar-downloader`. Downloader filters 
- Filed 2021 and 2025 (FY2020, FY2024): AMZN, IBM, JPM, MCD, META, TSLA, TGT, WMT
- Filed 2020 and 2024 (FY2020, FY2024): AAPL, COST, MSFT, PG  

**Fiscal year:** taken from the filing's `CONFORMED PERIOD OF REPORT`; January and February
year-ends are assigned to the prior year (Target's year ended Feb 1, 2025 = FY2024).

**Unit of analysis:** one paragraph = the text of the innermost block element (p, div, li, td).

**Filter:** keyword regex (case-insensitive): diversity, inclusion, inclusive, DEI, belonging,
racial, African American, underrepresented, Black (excluding "Black Friday & Black-Scholes").
Length 80-2000 characters. Exact-duplicate paragraphs removed within a filing.
Script and style tags removed. Section label (Item 1 / Item 1A) is a heuristic.

**Design choice:** recall first. The filter keeps borderline passages; labeling removes noise.

**Validation:** ski this in paper was unsuccessful & not needed
Random sample of 10 passages: 3 / 10 genuinely about DEI. Duplicates found: 0.

**Known limitations:** keyword filter misses DEI language that avoids these words;
table-of-contents lines can mislead section tags; paragraphs inside tables are handled as td blocks.

